      "normalized_combined_attack_recall": "Selected combined target coverage divided by the union coverage achievable by the scenario candidate pool."
    },
    "score_definitions": {
      "AC": "Inverse min-max normalized action count within the scenario candidate pool; 1 is the smallest available count and 0 is the largest.",
      "CC": "Candidate CVEs intersecting scenario CVEs divided by the number of scenario CVEs.",
      "DAC": "Distinct artifacts linked to the candidate through inferred ontology paths divided by the scenario artifact universe.",
      "DC": "Adjusted defensive-relation completeness: observed unique (ATT&CK technique, D3FEND relation) pairs divided by the scenario relation universe, multiplied by 1 - redundant_steps / matched_steps.",
